                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;a Signals Experiment with a GxP-GMP or GxP-DEV General template&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;an experiment- or system audit trail is requested by a user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160; an error occurs during the protocol&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;A message is shown on the sheet for the data (Excel or PDF)&#160; on which the error occurred to inform the user that the sheet is empty because of the error (and not because no data were found).&lt;br/&gt;
The message should contain:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;a descriptive message for the error&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;the time when the error occurred&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

